# Essence Channeler: "As long as you've lost life this turn, this creature has flying and vigilance" (CR 119.3, 611.3a: the
# effect of a static ability is not locked in, it applies whenever its condition holds). Bot1's Channeler has neither keyword
# while Bot1 has lost no life (checked in its own turn and again early in Bot2's turn); Bot2's Lightning Bolt to Bot1 in Bot2's
# own turn is life lost "this turn" (any player's turn), so the Channeler has both from that moment, in Bot2's turn. In Bot1's
# next turn Bot1 has lost no life that turn, so both are gone again: the condition reads this turn's events, not the game's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Plains
Essence Channeler
Plains x4
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x10

